  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 4 and takes about 1 hour 20 minutes plus at least 4 hours marinating time. The thing to watch is the onions: they need 30-40 minutes of slow cooking to collapse and caramelise properly. Rush them and you get sharp, harsh onions instead of the sweet, mellow base the dish is built on."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Grill or griddle the marinated chicken before it goes into the onion sauce. The char and smokiness from the grill is what separates yassa from a simple braise and is essential to the dish's character."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
